    "created_at": "2023-02-17T13:13:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-17T13:13:06Z",
    "body": "> Okay, in terms of PRs against the spec should we start by renaming \"none\" to \"from-image\", and in a later PR, re-add \"none\" with the new semantics?\r\n\r\nI realized now that the second part hasn't happened yet. Reopening to add `none` with the new semantics. Also see https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8710#issuecomment-1379790963",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
